  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHu/56",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-html\" data-ke-type=\"html\" data-source=\"&lt;div class=&quot;txc-textbox&quot; style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&amp;gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size23&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\"><div data-ke-class=\"article\"><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size23\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">생물의 다양성 단원을 시작할 때</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">우리학교 교과서는 변이를 이렇게 탐구합니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">. &lt;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">바지락 껍데기의 특징 비교하기</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&gt; </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">오늘 학교 일정 때문에 단축시정이어서 염려하였습니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">.‘40</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">분 만에 관찰하고 보고서까지 완성할 수 있을까</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">?’</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">라고요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">. </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">시간이 촉박하니까 오히려 집중력을 더 잘 발휘하네요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">. </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">우리 아이들 귀여운 산출물 몇 장 올립니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">제목들도 기발하지요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">? </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">정말 조비서가 왜 그럴까요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">? ㅎㅎ</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(마지막 사진은 시작 단계에서 촬영하였습니다. 바지락은 10개씩 나누어 주었고, 2인 1조로 탐구하며 공동 보고서를 기록하였습니다.)&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992937455B4571E91B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992937455B4571E91B\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8a116379838b7da6b5a707a1165b810f9a3faf8c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8a116379838b7da6b5a707a1165b810f9a3faf8c\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f7a25e87cc662ee1dea86de305112926874e8501\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f7a25e87cc662ee1dea86de305112926874e8501\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0f4130cf1dbfcd397afeed9aef52a19db73fa484\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0f4130cf1dbfcd397afeed9aef52a19db73fa484\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99424C455B45724D19\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99424C455B45724D19\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></span></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
